"""SOURCE-ONLY successor until separate reviewed native GO; NEW operation IDs only.

No production monkeypatch. Fixed current tools render/dispatch every real caller.
Faults affect only new task-owned transports and positively bound local clients;
the detached remote durable owner is never signalled, retried, or replaced.
"""
